        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not active yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belum cukup data untuk mengusulkan ambang baru — engine tetap memakai ambang konservatif bawaannya.": {
      "comment": "",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not enough data to propose a new threshold — the engine keeps using its conservative default."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belum dipilih": {
      "comment": "Nilai objek target Experiment 1 yang belum dipilih.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not selected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Benar": {
      "comment": "Jumlah cuplikan yang benar.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Correct"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Berkas ini memuat lokasi, kalibrasi, dan sigma yang berlaku saat merekam — tanpa itu, jarak kandidat dalam derajat tidak bisa ditafsirkan kembali.": {
      "comment": "",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file holds the location, calibration, and sigma in effect when the trial was recorded — without them, the candidate distances in degrees cannot be interpreted later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buang percobaan terakhir": {
      "comment": "Judul dialog konfirmasi saat menghapus satu percobaan.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discard the last trial?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
