        }
      }
    },
    "Sebagian sampel tidak menyertakan σ. Sigma yang tidak terukur ditulis 0, bukan angka bawaan — jangan dibaca sebagai akurasi sempurna.": {
      "comment": "",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some samples do not include σ. An unmeasured sigma is written as 0, not as a default value — do not read it as perfect accuracy."
